sequenceDiagram
  title Saving a diagram (compare-and-set)
  actor U as Editor
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant C as diagram-core
  participant D as Database
  U->>W: Save
  W->>A: PATCH /diagrams/:id with dslContent and baseVersionId
  A->>D: Check edit access (one grants query)
  A->>C: Parse and validate against the published standard
  C-->>A: Model and violations
  A->>D: Insert version, set current_version_id where it still equals baseVersionId
  alt someone saved first
    D-->>A: No row updated
    A-->>W: 409 version_conflict, who saved and when
    W->>U: Save mine anyway, load theirs, or keep editing
  else base still current
    D-->>A: Updated
    A-->>W: 200, new currentVersionId
  end
